@startuml
title E Visa Processing and Follow-Up System State Diagram

[*] --> CreateUserAccount
state "Create User Account" as CreateUserAccount
state "Login" as Login
state "LoggedInMenu" as LoggedInMenu
state "ApplicationProcessing" as ApplicationProcessing
state "Approved" as Approved
state "Rejected" as Rejected
state "ViewStatus" as ViewStatus
state "CheckStatus" as CheckStatus
state "CancelApplication" as CancelApplication
state "ModifyDetails" as ModifyDetails
state "ViewDetails" as ViewDetails
state "ViewPurpose" as ViewPurpose
state "GiveFeedback" as GiveFeedback
state "Logout" as Logout

CreateUserAccount --> Login : [account created]

Login --> LoggedInMenu : successful login

LoggedInMenu:
  do / access menu options
  transition based on user choice

LoggedInMenu --> ApplicationProcessing : apply for visa
LoggedInMenu --> ViewStatus : view status
LoggedInMenu --> CheckStatus : check status
LoggedInMenu --> CancelApplication : cancel application
LoggedInMenu --> ModifyDetails : modify details
LoggedInMenu --> ViewDetails : view details
LoggedInMenu --> ViewPurpose : view purpose
LoggedInMenu --> GiveFeedback : give feedback

ApplicationProcessing:
  entry / after login and payment made
  do / process application
  transition based on approval status

ApplicationProcessing --> Approved : approved
ApplicationProcessing --> Rejected : rejected

Approved --> ViewStatus : update status
Approved --> LoggedInMenu : back to menu

Rejected --> ViewStatus : update status
Rejected --> LoggedInMenu : back to menu

ViewStatus --> CheckStatus : check status
CheckStatus --> GiveFeedback : give feedback
CheckStatus --> Logout : log out

CancelApplication --> ViewStatus : update status
CancelApplication --> LoggedInMenu : back to menu

ModifyDetails --> ViewDetails : view details
ModifyDetails --> GiveFeedback : give feedback
ModifyDetails --> Logout : log out
ModifyDetails --> LoggedInMenu : back to menu

ViewDetails --> ModifyDetails : modify again if needed
ViewDetails --> GiveFeedback : give feedback
ViewDetails --> Logout : log out
ViewDetails --> LoggedInMenu : back to menu

ViewPurpose:
  entry / after login and document check
  do / view application purpose
  transition based on system decision

ViewPurpose --> ApplicationProcessing : reapply if needed
ViewPurpose --> ViewStatus : check status
ViewPurpose --> LoggedInMenu : back to menu
@enduml
